{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214250","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214250","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321425001:1":{"text":"あっ、このお守りも忘れないでくださいね！ご先祖さまが、あなたたちに残したものです！","source_cn":"喏，别忘了带走这个护身符！这可是先祖留给你们的遗物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x968E7D31AEAF1CA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321425002:1":{"text":"うん、大切にするよ。","source_cn":"谢谢，我一定会好好保存的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D97532510084EC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321425003:1":{"text":"町に戻ったら、俺とピーターはカミンスキー姓に戻すつもりだ。これからは俺たちの力でみんなの認識を改めさせてみせる。","source_cn":"等回到镇上，我会和彼得改回卡明斯基这个姓氏，靠自己的努...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91A5D78DCFB8444F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321425004:1":{"text":"もちろん、生きた屍のことも広く伝えていくつもりだ。もっと多くの人が、これまで日の目を見ることのなかった英雄の功績を知れば、屍への認識も変わるはず……","source_cn":"当然，我也会把活死人的事告诉大家，让更多人知道这些无名...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA08966726B7B803","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321425005:1":{"text":"それなら、お酒も控えないとね！","source_cn":"那你不能再喝酒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF5DE2E09FF75E3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321425006:1":{"text":"大丈夫。今日からは一滴も飲まないさ。","source_cn":"没问题，从今天开始，一滴也不会再碰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x921335C4CB5237BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321425007:1":{"text":"俺たちは勇敢なカミンスキーの血を継いでるんだ。もう落ちぶれた姿など見せられるか！","source_cn":"卡明斯基的后裔，当然要继承先祖的英勇，绝不会颓废度日！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE96003CA158430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斯捷潘":{"text":"ステパーン","source":"斯捷潘","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小彼得":{"text":"ピーター","source":"小彼得","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}